  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:36.170" end="00:40.110" ttm:agent="v1">Back here in town you ring my line</p>
      <p begin="00:40.110" end="00:42.000" ttm:agent="v1">From time to time</p>
      <p begin="00:42.000" end="00:45.300" ttm:agent="v1">I’m not hard to reach</p>
      <p begin="00:45.300" end="00:49.950" ttm:agent="v1">Don’t be so hard on me</p>
      <p begin="00:49.950" end="00:52.320" ttm:agent="v1">And we spend the day</p>
      <p begin="00:52.320" end="00:54.150" ttm:agent="v1">I spend the night</p>
      <p begin="00:54.150" end="00:56.170" ttm:agent="v1">You by my side</p>
      <p begin="00:56.170" end="00:59.350" ttm:agent="v1">Can’t close my eyes</p>
      <p begin="00:59.350" end="01:03.790" ttm:agent="v1">Haven’t held you in a while</p>
      <p begin="01:03.790" end="01:05.500" ttm:agent="v1">I’ve got a lot to miss</p>
      <p begin="01:05.500" end="01:07.000" ttm:agent="v1">Like your pretty lips</p>
      <p begin="01:06.980" end="01:08.480" ttm:agent="v1">In my car</p>
      <p begin="01:08.480" end="01:10.300" ttm:agent="v1">Take you where the city’s dim</p>
      <p begin="01:10.300" end="01:13.590" ttm:agent="v1">Hold my heart</p>
      <p begin="01:13.590" end="01:17.610" ttm:agent="v1">And we’re not far apart</p>
      <p begin="01:17.610" end="01:19.570" ttm:agent="v1">And I’ve got a lot to give</p>
      <p begin="01:19.570" end="01:21.100" ttm:agent="v1">But what’s the point in this</p>
      <p begin="01:21.100" end="01:22.600" ttm:agent="v1">If we part</p>
      <p begin="01:22.590" end="01:24.490" ttm:agent="v1">I’ll go wherever it is</p>
      <p begin="01:24.490" end="01:27.650" ttm:agent="v1">If you change your mind</p>
      <p begin="01:27.650" end="01:35.650" ttm:agent="v1">I’m not hard to find</p>
      <p begin="01:46.570" end="01:50.540" ttm:agent="v1">Post show we dine but we skip</p>
      <p begin="01:50.540" end="01:52.530" ttm:agent="v1">You're full of wine</p>
      <p begin="01:52.530" end="01:55.760" ttm:agent="v1">We waste some time</p>
      <p begin="01:55.760" end="02:00.720" ttm:agent="v1">Between you and I</p>
      <p begin="02:00.720" end="02:02.900" ttm:agent="v1">Come 2 am</p>
      <p begin="02:02.900" end="02:05.270" ttm:agent="v1">We search for sleep with</p>
      <p begin="02:05.270" end="02:07.000" ttm:agent="v1">Tangled limbs</p>
      <p begin="02:07.000" end="02:10.080" ttm:agent="v1">I rest my head</p>
      <p begin="02:10.080" end="02:14.500" ttm:agent="v1">Your hands on my neck</p>
      <p begin="02:14.500" end="02:16.100" ttm:agent="v1">I’ve got a lot to miss</p>
      <p begin="02:16.100" end="02:17.600" ttm:agent="v1">Like your pretty lips</p>
      <p begin="02:17.530" end="02:19.160" ttm:agent="v1">In my car</p>
      <p begin="02:19.160" end="02:20.880" ttm:agent="v1">Take you where the city’s dim</p>
      <p begin="02:20.880" end="02:24.170" ttm:agent="v1">Hold my heart</p>
      <p begin="02:24.170" end="02:28.030" ttm:agent="v1">And we’re not far apart</p>
      <p begin="02:28.030" end="02:30.130" ttm:agent="v1">And I’ve got a lot to give</p>
      <p begin="02:30.130" end="02:31.640" ttm:agent="v1">But what’s the point in this</p>
      <p begin="02:31.640" end="02:33.160" ttm:agent="v1">If we part</p>
      <p begin="02:33.160" end="02:35.050" ttm:agent="v1">I’ll go wherever it is</p>
      <p begin="02:35.050" end="02:38.300" ttm:agent="v1">If you change your mind</p>
      <p begin="02:38.300" end="02:46.300" ttm:agent="v1">I’m not hard to find</p>
      <p begin="03:10.750" end="03:12.570" ttm:agent="v1">I’ve got a lot to miss</p>
      <p begin="03:12.570" end="03:14.070" ttm:agent="v1">Like your pretty lips</p>
      <p begin="03:13.970" end="03:15.610" ttm:agent="v1">In my car</p>
      <p begin="03:15.610" end="03:17.340" ttm:agent="v1">Take you where the city’s dim</p>
      <p begin="03:17.340" end="03:20.610" ttm:agent="v1">Hold my heart</p>
      <p begin="03:20.610" end="03:24.710" ttm:agent="v1">And we’re not far apart</p>
      <p begin="03:24.710" end="03:26.620" ttm:agent="v1">And I’ve got a lot to give</p>
      <p begin="03:26.620" end="03:28.120" ttm:agent="v1">But what’s the point in this</p>
      <p begin="03:28.110" end="03:29.700" ttm:agent="v1">If we part</p>
      <p begin="03:29.700" end="03:31.590" ttm:agent="v1">I’ll go wherever it is</p>
      <p begin="03:31.590" end="03:34.800" ttm:agent="v1">If you change your mind</p>
      <p begin="03:34.800" end="03:42.800" ttm:agent="v1">I’m not hard to find</p>
      <p begin="04:41.480" end="04:44.930" ttm:agent="v1">If you change your mind</p>
      <p begin="04:44.930" end="04:48.930" ttm:agent="v1">I’m not hard to find</p>
